# Keep EAS archive lean — local QA artifacts must never upload
artifacts/
**/artifacts/
*.apk
*.aab
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.expo/
apps/mobile/.expo/
# Never ship a locally prebuilt native project — APP_VARIANT icons must regenerate on EAS
apps/mobile/android/
apps/mobile/ios/
**/android/app/build/
**/ios/Pods/
_tmp*/
**/_tmp*/
agent-transcripts/
*.log
**/*.log
